sive high school class trip are stolen, sophomore Yuichi and his four best friends are kidnapped by Manabu, a surreal character from a creepy late-night anime show. The mischievous Manabu challenges the students to a series of mind games that the five must decipher and outwit in order to win back their trip funds, uncover the thief, and pay off a huge and mysterious debt.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sszG61Yxq2CAeYlRqPexRojMOVQ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Eh? Yuichi sospetta dei suoi amici?","synopsis":"After the hard-earned funds for their expensive high school class trip are stolen, sophomore Yuichi and his four best friends are kidnapped by Manabu, a surreal character from a creepy late-night anime show. The mischievous Manabu challenges the students to a series of mind games that the five must decipher and outwit in order to win back their trip funds, uncover the thief, and pay off a huge and mysterious debt.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sszG61Yxq2CAeYlRqPexRojMOVQ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Avete molto da dirmi, vero?","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"60310","synopsis":"Yuichi and friends reach the end of Kokkuri-san, uncovering dimensions of trickery in the Tomodachi Game that they hadn't imagined. When they move on to a second game, a socially destructive version of sugoroku, the group struggles to maintain balance as personal secrets are revealed and trust is stretched to its absolute limit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hce3tOxQlOL9iTOEZ3EgcwM50VP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Avete molto da dirmi, vero?","synopsis":"Yuichi and friends reach the end of Kokkuri-san, uncovering dimensions of trickery in the Tomodachi Game that they hadn't imagined. When they move on to a second game, a socially destructive version of sugoroku, the group struggles to maintain balance as personal secrets are revealed and trust is stretched to its absolute limit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hce3tOxQlOL9iTOEZ3EgcwM50VP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"È impossibile che io ci creda","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"60446","synopsis":"Dark secrets are exposed as the second game, Bad-Mouth Sugoroku, continues. Yutori is devastated when a traumatic episode from her past is revealed, leading her to suspect the only other person who knew—Shiho. As debts increase, the five friends are driven further apart. With no one else to turn to, Yutori clings to Yuichi for help, and Yuichi pledges his support.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wok7huBS55WdV635gCUmuj5EksH.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"È impossibile che io ci creda","synopsis":"Dark secrets are exposed as the second game, Bad-Mouth Sugoroku, continues. Yutori is devastated when a traumatic episode from her past is revealed, leading her to suspect the only other person who knew—Shiho. As debts increase, the five friends are driven further apart. With no one else to turn to, Yutori clings to Yuichi for help, and Yuichi pledges his support.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wok7huBS55WdV635gCUmuj5EksH.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Ma davvero? È disgustoso!","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"60668","synopsis":"Responsible for the theft of the class funds, the application to play Tomodachi Game, and the exposure of all kinds of dirty secrets in Bad-Mouth Sugoroku, Tenji now tries to alienate Shiho from the others so he can have her all to himself. As a result of his attempts, a rift develops between Shiho and Yutori that threatens to destroy their friendship. But while Tenji is busy sweet-talking Shiho and planning his next move, a \"special chance\" appears for Shiho that might change the direction of the game.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mbLBELYhMbD4cL4GSoPdMfEGRW6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Ma davvero? È disgustoso!","synopsis":"Responsible for the theft of the class funds, the application to play Tomodachi Game, and the exposure of all kinds of dirty secrets in Bad-Mouth Sugoroku, Tenji now tries to alienate Shiho from the others so he can have her all to himself. As a result of his attempts, a rift develops between Shiho and Yutori that threatens to destroy their friendship. But while Tenji is busy sweet-talking Shiho and planning his next move, a \"special chance\" appears for Shiho that might change the direction of the game.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mbLBELYhMbD4cL4GSoPdMfEGRW6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Yuichi, sei piuttosto idiota, vero?","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"61088","synopsis":"Shibe reels from the accusation that he has \"actually killed a person.\" Despite protesting that he never did such a thing, he loses the audience's confidence and is thrust into first place. Meanwhile, Tenji finds himself in a distressing situation after realizing Yuichi is the one who wrote the card. Yuichi then makes the shocking announcement that he knows who the traitor is.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zEUeoJBcQVHnIGAhSaS5t1nfhvH.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Yuichi, sei piuttosto idiota, vero?","synopsis":"Shibe reels from the accusation that he has \"actually killed a person.\" Despite protesting that he never did such a thing, he loses the audience's confidence and is thrust into first place. Meanwhile, Tenji finds himself in a distressing situation after realizing Yuichi is the one who wrote the card. Yuichi then makes the shocking announcement that he knows who the traitor is.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zEUeoJBcQVHnIGAhSaS5t1nfhvH.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Pare proprio che nessuno voglia essere amico di un \"assassino\"","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"61531","synopsis":"Backed into a corner by Yuichi's plan, Tenji is forced to confess that he applied to play Tomodachi Game. Yuichi spells out the traps he set to smoke out the traitor and reveals that he had been manipulating the game from the start. The second game then reaches a breathtakingly unexpected conclusion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYfrXcCWSdcDuNgPujldesONhZV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Pare proprio che nessuno voglia essere amico di un \"assassino\"","synopsis":"Backed into a corner by Yuichi's plan, Tenji is forced to confess that he applied to play Tomodachi Game. Yuichi spells out the traps he set to smoke out the traitor and reveals that he had been manipulating the game from the start. The second game then reaches a breathtakingly unexpected conclusion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYfrXcCWSdcDuNgPujldesONhZV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Prenderò l'equivalente di 20 milioni di yen dalla tua vita","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"61663","synopsis":"After clearing Bad-Mouth Sugoroku, Yuichi and Tenji find themselves trapped in a dark cave for three days. During their isolation, Tenji makes the shocking revelation that he had already experienced a Tomodachi Game in the past. Meanwhile, a team of new opponents lies in wait outside, anxious to challenge the two partners to a grueling third game.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oQcCc48XAT8NJwtM8FQIPavUwlD.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Prenderò l'equivalente di 20 milioni di yen dalla tua vita","synopsis":"After clearing Bad-Mouth Sugoroku, Yuichi and Tenji find themselves trapped in a dark cave for three days. During their isolation, Tenji makes the shocking revelation that he had already experienced a Tomodachi Game in the past. Meanwhile, a team of new opponents lies in wait outside, anxious to challenge the two partners to a grueling third game.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oQcCc48XAT8NJwtM8FQIPavUwlD.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"È un gioco dove si aspetta e aspetta e aspetta... e si continua ad aspettare","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"61743","synopsis":"The third game, Friendly Hide-and-Seek, begins. Rival Group K, bolstered by an apparent 'genius' strategist, proceeds with a clear numerical advantage. Eager to regain Yuichi's trust, Tenji volunteers to be Group C's hider, but the couple's plans are strained by the addition of a new female teammate, Mizuse Maria. Yuichi confidently tells Tenji to \"just trust me and wait,\" but then doesn't return for days...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8LfESAMHHMvwAsiHFM9rLIeYIkI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"È un gioco dove si aspetta e aspetta e aspetta... e si continua ad aspettare","synopsis":"The third game, Friendly Hide-and-Seek, begins. Rival Group K, bolstered by an apparent 'genius' strategist, proceeds with a clear numerical advantage. Eager to regain Yuichi's trust, Tenji volunteers to be Group C's hider, but the couple's plans are strained by the addition of a new female teammate, Mizuse Maria. Yuichi confidently tells Tenji to \"just trust me and wait,\" but then doesn't return for days...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8LfESAMHHMvwAsiHFM9rLIeYIkI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Sbrigati e \"cambia squadra\"","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141014","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50273","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"137718","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"62090","synopsis":"Yuichi, who hasn’t left the starting point in the two days since the game began, suddenly announces his desire to switch to Group K. The Group K members, puzzled by Yuichi’s apparent intention to abandon his hiding teammate, ask their Captain to decide whether or not to let Yuichi in. Meanwhile, Tenji, who has stayed in hiding and trusted Yuichi all along, is finally reaching his physical breaking point.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5dpv7nSPKSbbEqHB6SooB71NxuB.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Sbrigati e \"cambia squadra\"","synopsis":"Yuichi, who hasn’t left the starting point in the two days since the game began, suddenly announces his desire to switch to Group K. The Group K members, puzzled by Yuichi’s apparent intention to abandon his hiding teammate, ask their Captain to decide whether or not to let Yuichi in. Meanwhile, Tenji, who has stayed in hiding and trusted Yuichi all along, is finally reaching his physical breaking point.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5dpv7nSPKSbbEqHB6SooB71NxuB.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"E qui si conclude il terzo gioco!","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16948","scope":"R","episodeNum